+// Blademaster (965862): parrying an attack, or a melee ability critical strike (at most once every 8 sec), adds a stack
+// of Study the Blade; 3 stacks become Blademaster (10 sec): critical strike rating +25% of Strength (the tooltip's
+// number; the spell data has 15%, plus expertise), and empowered abilities for as long, from Ascension's own spells:
+// Devastate deals 70% weapon damage to enemies around you and takes another 10% off the target's armor for 5 sec;
+// Divine Storm gives Armor and Holy spell damage equal to 100% of Strength for 5 sec; Riposte adds Deflecting
