+// Champion of Justice (986000): teaches Righteous Justice (985957, wcme_enchant_teach) and Crusader's Promise (985993).
+// While Righteous Justice is up you gain healing power from 20% of your attack power (985994) and Crusader's Justice
+// crits 20% more often (Righteous Justice's own spell mod); Crusader's Justice and Crusader's Promise need it.
+// Divine Storm then heals 2 allies within 40 yards over time with Divine Justice (985976: 4% AP + 3% SP + 1 per tick,
+// +30% Holy healing taken), 1 more per Debt of Justice stack. Each Crusader's Promise adds a Debt of Justice stack
+// (985977 and 985978: the next Promise heals less) and takes 1 sec off Divine Storm; Divine Storm spends the stacks.
+// Crusader's Justice (985972, spell_wcme_crusaders_justice) on an ally heals it (985974: 1 + weapon speed x (12% AP +
+// 8% healing power)) and bonds you to it; on an enemy it strikes for 60% weapon damage (985973), and that damage also
+// heals your bonded ally (985998) and restores 10% of your base mana. In a 1v1 arena these heals are halved.
+// In a 1v1 arena, Champion of Justice's healing is halved ("significantly decreased in 1v1 arena").
+uint32 WcmeSoloArenaHeal(Unit* healer, uint32 amount)
+{
+    Player* player = healer->ToPlayer();
+    Battleground* bg = player ? player->GetBattleground() : nullptr;
+    return bg && bg->isArena() && bg->GetArenaType() == ARENA_TYPE_1v1 ? amount / 2 : amount;
+}
